error[E0277]: `Bits` does not fill the storage
 --> tests/ui/from_limbs_partial_width.rs:8:16
  |
8 |   let _value = Uint::<U200, [u64; 4]>::from_limbs([0; 4]);
  |                ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ `Bits` is less than the bits of the storage
  |
  = help: the trait `numo::width::sealed::ReprFilled` is not implemented for `B0`
  = note: `[u64; N]` holds `64 * N` bits
  = note: `checked_from_limbs` takes the limbs of any width that fits and checks the value
help: the trait `numo::width::sealed::ReprFilled` is implemented for `B1`
 --> src/width.rs
  |
  |   impl ReprFilled for typenum::B1 {}
  |   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  = note: required for `UInt<UInt<UInt<UInt<UInt<UInt<UInt<UInt<UTerm, B1>, B1>, B0>, B0>, B1>, B0>, B0>, B0>` to implement `numo::width::sealed::SealedFillsRepr<[u64; 4]>`
  = note: required for `UInt<UInt<UInt<UInt<UInt<UInt<UInt<UInt<UTerm, B1>, B1>, B0>, B0>, B1>, B0>, B0>, B0>` to implement `FillsRepr<[u64; 4]>`
note: required by a bound in `Uint::<B, [u64; N]>::from_limbs`
 --> src/integer.rs
  |
  |   pub const fn from_limbs(limbs: [u64; N]) -> Self
  |                ---------- required by a bound in this associated function
  |   where
  |     B: FillsRepr<[u64; N]>,
  |        ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ required by this bound in `Uint::<B, [u64; N]>::from_limbs`

